+## 5. Rebuilding an existing tree
+
+`build-rnsbox.sh` never rebuilds the kernel. After you apply a newer series
+to a tree that has already been built, or change the kernel config, kernel
+sources or device tree yourself, do a clean kernel and `osdrv` rebuild first:
+
+```
+./build-rnsbox-kclean.sh
+./build-rnsbox.sh lite    # or dvd
